<view class="container" bindtap="onAnyTap">

  <view class="page-header">
    <text class="page-title">我的</text>
    <view class="page-subtitle">KIWI待办 · 云端同步</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 节假日维护置顶：放假 / 调休补班自行维护，改完对所有待办生效 -->
  <view class="card" bindtap="goHolidays">
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="title">节假日维护</text>
      <text class="small muted">放假 / 调休补班 ›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="small muted" style="margin-top:10rpx">{{holidayHint}}</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 微信订阅消息推送：授权入口（只保留按钮，不加状态横幅/引导文案） -->
  <view class="card">
    <text class="title">微信订阅消息推送</text>
    <view class="small muted" style="margin-top:10rpx">待办到点时通过微信服务通知提醒你。</view>
    <view class="row auth-btns">
      <view class="btn btn-ghost auth-btn" bindtap="onAuthTap">开启推送服务</view>
      <view class="btn btn-ghost auth-btn" bindtap="onRenewTap">补充提醒次数</view>
      <view class="btn btn-ghost auth-btn" bindtap="onTestTap">发送测试提醒</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 网页/电脑端同步：口令绑定到本账号，电脑浏览器、安卓/iOS 浏览器与小程序互相同步 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="title">网页 / 电脑端同步</text>
      <text wx:if="{{syncCode}}" class="link" bindtap="onSyncRevoke">作废口令</text>
    </view>
    <view class="small muted" style="margin-top:10rpx">
      在电脑浏览器、手机浏览器打开 KIWI待办网页版，输入这个口令即可和这里互相同步待办。
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{syncCode}}" class="sync-code-box" bindtap="onSyncGenerate">
      <text class="sync-code">{{syncCode}}</text>
      <text class="small muted">{{syncExpireText || '点击复制'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="btn" style="margin-top:20rpx" bindtap="onSyncGenerate">
      {{syncCode ? '复制口令' : '生成同步口令'}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="title">{{signedIn ? '已登录' : '未登录'}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{signedIn}}" class="link" bindtap="onSignOut">退出登录</text>
    </view>
    <view class="small muted" style="margin-top:10rpx">
      {{signedIn ? '待办与提醒记录已保存在云端，换设备自动同步。' : '登录后才能保存待办和提醒记录。'}}
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="btn" style="margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="onLogin">微信一键登录</view>
  </view>

</view>
